// A change through the SDLC gates: design, build, independent verification,
// security, privacy and compliance, then release approval.
// Vars: peer, folder, change, change_id, reviewers (a squad), test, lint, secscan,
//       licenses, secrets, privacy_approver, approver
claim: SDLC-1 The change is implemented and the owner's tests and lint pass
claim: SDLC-2 Another peer applied the change on its own copy and the tests pass there too
claim: SDLC-3 The security scan passes and a reviewer accepted the security review
claim: SDLC-4 The privacy champion accepted how the change handles personal data
claim: SDLC-5 Dependency licenses and the secret scan pass
claim: SDLC-6 The change was approved for release
design @{{peer}}:{{folder}} skill=design-doc context=architecture,risks save=design-{{change_id}} Write a short design for this change: {{change}}. Cover the affected components, data touched, risks, rollout and the test plan.
impl after design @{{peer}}:{{folder}} skill=implement-change context=architecture verify={{test}},{{lint}} attempts=3 claims=SDLC-1 Implement this change: {{change}}. Follow the design above and add or update tests.
verify after impl #{{reviewers}}:{{folder}} skill=code-review apply=impl verify={{test}} claims=SDLC-2 Review this change independently: read the diff, run the tests and report any problem.
security after impl #{{reviewers}}:{{folder}} skill=security-review apply=impl verify={{secscan}} claims=SDLC-3 Security review of this change: injection, authentication and authorization, secrets, unsafe input handling, dependencies. List findings with severity, or say "No high-severity findings".
security-ok after security approve @{{approver}} claims=SDLC-3 Accept the security review of: {{change}}.
privacy after impl #{{reviewers}}:{{folder}} skill=privacy-review apply=impl context=risks save=privacy-{{change_id}} Privacy review of this change: which personal data it collects, stores, logs or sends; the purpose, retention and who can access it; anything unnecessary.
privacy-ok after privacy approve @{{privacy_approver}} claims=SDLC-4 Accept the privacy review of: {{change}}.
compliance after impl #{{reviewers}}:{{folder}} skill=compliance-check apply=impl verify={{licenses}},{{secrets}} claims=SDLC-5 Check the dependency licenses and that no secrets are committed; summarize.
release after verify,security-ok,privacy-ok,compliance approve @{{approver}} claims=SDLC-6 Approve releasing: {{change}}.